#: scenario8:scenario8_538603F2_DF0F_4375_93D4_E9F2786EFA69
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 52f2b93bfc8838dbb0747a7e4241276e65cb00b58da3811483d96e304e220c85
#. default-sha256: d1afbc270efa3764a1f2bd7b929fa5436698f26b040646b46cafc14883f1ec02
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_538603F2_DF0F_4375_93D4_E9F2786EFA69"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫When he takes the necklace, Jacopo looks as though he’s on the "
"verge of tears."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Mentre Jacopo afferra il ciondolo, sembra essere sul punto di "
"piangere."

#: scenario8:scenario8_B0BC1945_691B_4EF0_AC20_A025AC10EF48
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8d7eff9f9264cb3d582d7cdea6a33de9168212d62c53a7aacdc280688f814635
#. default-sha256: 408307f09e3c4e04bb0f504be8c3962d16a57b6ea0dab6fe4d430d3da8e1045c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B0BC1945_691B_4EF0_AC20_A025AC10EF48"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Whether from the pressure of not wanting to lose face, or simply because he’s no longer able "
"to, he doesn’t actually shed any, though."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma non lo fa, ⟪k:1⟫forse perché non vuole perdere la faccia,⟪k:2⟫o semplicemente perché non "
"ha più lacrime da versare."

#: scenario8:scenario8_9DACE528_5CF3_410D_A06C_DFDBE77E8496
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6a6823b5653d3795708aa3d106ae228366c6379c4b56e51d194819c795d80f5f
#. default-sha256: fe9de7ae45ae32a291e1a25a9f02d03c2aa0c03983946e854a4dc4213d62ff21
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_9DACE528_5CF3_410D_A06C_DFDBE77E8496"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The other two just stand and watch him quietly."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Gli altri due restano a guardarlo in silenzio."

#: scenario8:scenario8_9E494A6D_9D0A_4A0A_B295_7EAC70594827
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 69ae9c18ed30b8c109855ae883e4391590ce9eadd2f915f94fc9401250f01f40
#. default-sha256: 4ab6c14c552a070019bddb9ce484298d32b9ce5fa7229a8ec7cf93d8417f6e35
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_9E494A6D_9D0A_4A0A_B295_7EAC70594827"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Neither of them saw the vision of his past, but they don’t pry either."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nessuno di loro ha assistito alla visione del suo passato,⟪k:1⟫tuttavia non fanno domande, "
"né si intromettono in alcun modo."

#: scenario8:scenario8_A65628ED_B3F4_4482_8AA8_AB8B6F5FBA83
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: af18f24cfe4502323cdb8128776bc3a39d3abe7ced34283f31da8221f1589afc
#. default-sha256: 66841114675de0f472eb906c7c4170768db68007f766d93dc15cdd77aafdd63d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_A65628ED_B3F4_4482_8AA8_AB8B6F5FBA83"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Our exchange was probably sufficient to give them an idea of what happened, even if they "
"don’t know the details."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Probabilmente il nostro scambio è bastato a dar loro un’idea di quello che è successo, anche "
"se non conoscono i dettagli."

#: scenario8:scenario8_4331D23C_A965_432D_BF48_DCF3CB7E5BB4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3ae084814f146764046cbd9f740a64cd0a3884a30db89eee061056ee240a2b1d
#. default-sha256: 9cc5aecb37fe88aa436631b36f4046c641c020ba0abeb65701221bc71f295367
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4331D23C_A965_432D_BF48_DCF3CB7E5BB4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Clutching the necklace in one hand, Jacopo takes up the head of the procession to the "
"observation tower."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Stringendo il ciondolo nella mano, Jacopo conduce la processione verso la torre "
"d’osservazione."

#: scenario8:scenario8_E1DFF7A8_FE7F_4E19_8D0A_6122F084BA4D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7b01935da41dc9ae81b0bf7114f13e5dfb6e75f9a21c545644e750741c221125
