"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫They "
"each insert and turn their individual keys,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫Ognuno "
"di loro inserisce e ruota la propria chiave."

#: scenario8:scenario8_78C4A1AD_06F0_404A_A911_289C2D1A8545
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5ae5d36d0a74bb777bd7960dccbd32883cc4dc334b7878d47be1f4d0981068f2
#. default-sha256: c43ff1bf18a1e6ef418eccfeebda58c2338d992f432dfddfe8ab3c8a7e14db9c
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_78C4A1AD_06F0_404A_A911_289C2D1A8545"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫the lock disengaging and the door giving a deep groan as it swings open."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Il lucchetto si sblocca, e la porta genera un profondo lamento mentre⟪k:1⟫si spalanca."

#: scenario8:scenario8_23F4E655_115E_47D8_81D4_32424412E816
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8294fcc1cfcca6d2779840863edc1e99c706400ac2c1577ff0449286f913d37f
#. default-sha256: 96e0f658e33fa4a638543edb05c61dbf87295df9ffa797a4c4286c436c529171
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_23F4E655_115E_47D8_81D4_32424412E816"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Beyond it, a spiral staircase extends high into the sky."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Oltre la soglia, una scala a chiocciola si estende in alto fino al cielo."

#: scenario8:scenario8_039FE425_1400_4CF4_91E9_3587DDD3BA30
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3bc09fccdd6e51c453e01c3713f1174a89e2032bd30d3db5af46ca5f57518b82
#. default-sha256: bc47a7943056fa677189ee7a20fd48bd5b60fc4b740310965b418412190d3419
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_039FE425_1400_4CF4_91E9_3587DDD3BA30"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Every time I’ve climbed these stairs, it’s always been a solemn affair—⟪k:1⟫and now is no "
"different."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tutte le volte in cui ho percorso questi gradini, è sempre stato un momento solenne—⟪k:1⟫e "
"stavolta non è da meno."

#: scenario8:scenario8_2940BC09_DF88_414F_83CD_7E63A3C23521
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 01f5f2a565a238ed759a4c9a5dd2c8a20de043da9bd9e1a07c3ed60d9f9c8368
#. default-sha256: 27bc1111ba6b7262fca98e18a853605ecc571040ec6a21900b1ffeed2616800b
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_2940BC09_DF88_414F_83CD_7E63A3C23521"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I’ve succeeded, though. I’ve got them all here,⟪k:1⟫ready to set her free before she’s "
"supposed to die."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫In ogni caso, ce l’ho fatta. Li ho riuniti tutti qui,⟪k:1⟫pronti per liberarla prima della "
"sua morte."

#: scenario8:scenario8_1A5A083C_156A_46D0_A0BC_EED6903904BE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bd8a8c5d482e5dae22cd820fd8dc2591b5eecae7c8a89f6cae2582e9e21beeee
