#: scenario8:scenario8_52A585C6_D183_4D44_9B87_E24EC8892F9F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6f56878417546adb000c4c5573e6609230757d574f2a00d6518208e3ebd75313
