msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫There couldn’t be. It’s only Morgana."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Impossibile. Dentro c’è solo Morgana."

#: scenario8:scenario8_90CC1DC7_EBA9_415C_975A_E1CCEC9571C7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7dbb1a06c0a25ff10fca39df82a1a308900650c3d9d7c2d8bb50b064eda966cc
